  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6659464",
      "title": "Syncing HTML with the Form",
      "lectureOrder": 553,
      "videoOrder": 508,
      "sourceHash": "a077fb776f3ed7f7d9766dfd86a6eac5ce2a88c5390000f109f05d7cbdc7aa5d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.46,
          "end": 4.32,
          "en": "Male Presenter: So we created our form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.32,
          "end": 7.12,
          "en": "Let's now synchronize it to the HTML code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.12,
          "end": 10.541,
          "en": "For this, first of all, and that's very important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.541,
          "end": 13.98,
          "en": "We need to add something to the app module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.98,
          "end": 15.51,
          "en": "in the imports array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.51,
          "end": 17.92,
          "en": "We now not only need the forms module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.92,
          "end": 22.65,
          "en": "we'll also need the reactive forms module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.65,
          "end": 25.861,
          "en": "which needs to be imported from at angular forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.861,
          "end": 30.861,
          "en": "Otherwise, synchronizing with our HTML code will fail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.68,
          "end": 32.94,
          "en": "because we don't have access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.94,
          "end": 34.743,
          "en": "to the directives we need for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.67,
          "end": 38.25,
          "en": "So therefore what I'll do is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 40.991,
          "en": "go to my recipe added component HTML file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.991,
          "end": 43.703,
          "en": "And now I want to connect my form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.703,
          "end": 47.13,
          "en": "Let's start on the overall form element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.13,
          "end": 51.84,
          "en": "Here we have the form group directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.84,
          "end": 52.83,
          "en": "which we should use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.83,
          "end": 56.01,
          "en": "with square brackets because we need to pass some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.01,
          "end": 58.703,
          "en": "to that directive while, property binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.703,
          "end": 61.83,
          "en": "And that data is our recipe form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.83,
          "end": 63.864,
          "en": "So let's quickly assign this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.864,
          "end": 68.34,
          "en": "Now we're telling angler that our overall form is managed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.34,
          "end": 71.49,
          "en": "by us, and that angler itself should not manage it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.49,
          "end": 73.443,
          "en": "Instead, it should take our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.37,
          "end": 79.32,
          "en": "With this, we can now assign our own controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.32,
          "end": 82.8,
          "en": "So let's simply go to a first input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.8,
          "end": 84.24,
          "en": "the name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.24,
          "end": 87,
          "en": "and there we have to form control name directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87,
          "end": 89.76,
          "en": "Now we could enclose it in square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.76,
          "end": 91.86,
          "en": "and then use single quotation marks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.86,
          "end": 93.47800000000001,
          "en": "between the double quotation marks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.47800000000001,
          "end": 97.257,
          "en": "or we omit both and simply use this syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.257,
          "end": 98.718,
          "en": "And now the name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.718,
          "end": 102.449,
          "en": "of course has to match the name we set up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.449,
          "end": 104.19800000000001,
          "en": "So here we chose name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.19800000000001,
          "end": 107.013,
          "en": "We should choose the same in the HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.24000000000001,
          "end": 112.37,
          "en": "Now we'll copy this also for the image URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.37,
          "end": 115.97999999999999,
          "en": "Here I chose Image Path as a name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 119.431,
          "en": "So let's make sure to use this and of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.431,
          "end": 123.032,
          "en": "description for our text area here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.032,
          "end": 126.872,
          "en": "Here I also will add the form group name directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.872,
          "end": 129.243,
          "en": "and assign description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.26,
          "end": 132.75,
          "en": "Now to be able to see something, I'll also set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.75,
          "end": 136.831,
          "en": "up the NG Submit Listener and listen to on submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.831,
          "end": 138,
          "en": "Now here, of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 140.49,
          "en": "I don't need to pass the form as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.49,
          "end": 145.49,
          "en": "Instead, I can simply add the On submit method here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.551,
          "end": 150.551,
          "en": "And for now, simply log my recipe form to the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.05,
          "end": 154.05,
          "en": "Let's see if everything works as it should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.05,
          "end": 156.273,
          "en": "So once this has recompiled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.68,
          "end": 159.93,
          "en": "I'll head over to the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.93,
          "end": 162.75,
          "en": "and this looks okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.75,
          "end": 167.75,
          "en": "It almost works as expected the name was Prepopulated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.12,
          "end": 172.56,
          "en": "for the selected recipe, and it does update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.56,
          "end": 175.135,
          "en": "if we change this to Big Fat Burger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.135,
          "end": 178.426,
          "en": "The description is not displayed though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.426,
          "end": 182.215,
          "en": "So that is not how I want this to behave.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.215,
          "end": 184.47,
          "en": "As a side note on new recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.47,
          "end": 187.284,
          "en": "it correctly sets this to an empty form, so that is okay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 187.284,
          "end": 191.236,
          "en": "but would be nice if the description is displayed too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.236,
          "end": 192.825,
          "en": "If I submit the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.825,
          "end": 197.825,
          "en": "let's have a look at the value description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.27,
          "end": 201.39,
          "en": "Actually, it says what else you need to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.39,
          "end": 204.63,
          "en": "So what could be wrong about the description then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.63,
          "end": 206.61,
          "en": "Well, if we have a look at the text area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.61,
          "end": 208.53,
          "en": "I simply assigned the wrong directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.53,
          "end": 210.81,
          "en": "It should be form control name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.81,
          "end": 214.00900000000001,
          "en": "with this in place, if it reloads, this looks much better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.00900000000001,
          "end": 218.321,
          "en": "So with that, desynchronization is working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.321,
          "end": 223.321,
          "en": "The next step is to get our ingredients to work correctly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.37,
          "end": 226.26,
          "en": "and that actually will involve a couple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.26,
          "end": 228.54,
          "en": "of steps because we need to manage this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.54,
          "end": 230.28300000000002,
          "en": "of ingredients for that.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
